# CIS navigation

- **Back:** One fixed control — `#cis-float-nav` in `shell/app.js`. Label is always **Back** (never “Back to …” / “Return to …”). One click = one step (drill via `setFloatingBack`, else `navStack` pop).
- **Do not** add in-page back links or extra float buttons in modules.
- **Drill-down:** `ctx.setFloatingBack({ onClick })` when entering; `setFloatingBack(null)` when leaving.
- **Hub hierarchy:** set `parentModule` on the module (or `MODULE_PARENTS` in `app.js`) so float back shows the correct parent title.
